@startuml
!include _style.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> LoggedOut
LoggedOut --> Registering : open Sign Up
Registering --> LoggedIn : account created
Registering --> Registering : invalid / duplicate email
LoggedOut --> Authenticating : submit credentials
Authenticating --> LoggedIn : valid credentials
Authenticating --> LoggedOut : invalid credentials
LoggedOut --> ResettingPassword : Forgot password
ResettingPassword --> LoggedOut : password updated
state LoggedIn {
  [*] --> EnteringHealthData
  EnteringHealthData --> Validating : Predict Risk
  Validating --> EnteringHealthData : invalid input
  Validating --> Predicting : input valid
  Predicting --> ViewingResult : result returned
  ViewingResult --> ReportDownloaded : Download PDF
  ReportDownloaded --> ViewingResult
  ViewingResult --> EnteringHealthData : Predict Again
  EnteringHealthData --> ViewingHistory : History
  ViewingHistory --> ViewingResult : View
}
LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : Logout / token expired
@enduml
